    {
      "height": 120,
      "id": "616bf96a9a610f8e",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "## [[Robot Code Basics]]\n\nLearn about the structure and layout of a Robot codebase",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": -2140,
      "y": 3640
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 200,
      "id": "503e9a189daf4687",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "# Kitbot Minimum Goals\n- Open Loop Control\n- Teleop Control\n- Simple control states + Commands\n- Simple time-oriented sequences",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 540,
      "x": -2140,
      "y": 4080
    },
    {
      "height": 120,
      "id": "17c2a717aa632c73",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "## [[Basic Motor Control]]\nGet something moving and interact with a Rev motor controller\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 320,
      "x": -1740,
      "y": 3640
    },
    {
      "height": 120,
      "id": "4dca48ed95205841",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "## [[Creating a Differential Drive]]\n\nSet up a Differential Drivetrain, typically used on Kitbots\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 380,
      "x": -1320,
      "y": 3640
    },
    {
      "height": 120,
      "id": "ab640dd821231881",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "## [[Commands+Controllers]]\n\nLearn how to change robot behaviours  using a controller",
