      "width": 400,
      "x": -840,
      "y": 3640
    },
    {
      "height": 110,
      "id": "5476b611882c59cc",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "## [[Intro to Robot Mechanisms]]\n\nLearn about the Kitbot anad how it interacts with game pieces",
