    {
      "height": 281,
      "id": "6a7c12b5c0e475ee",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "Advanced Control\n\nDetermine control options\n- Model/Feedforwards?\n- Feedback\n\t- PID\n\t- Bang-Bang\n\t- State-oriented\n- Motion Profiles?",
