      "id": "8e8d2bbfd0c0d5e1",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "Managing System State\n- State = robot/mechanism configuration\n- Multi-system interactions\n- Subsystem initialization\n- Command Groups\n- State Machines? \n- Sequencing?",
